          "question": "What will be the output of the following Java program?\n    class bitwise_operator\n    {\n        public static void main(String args[])\n        {\n             int a = 3;\n             int b = 6;\n \t     int c = a | b;\n             int d = a & b;\n             System.out.println(c + \" \"  + d);\n        }\n    }",
